     <abstract pn="section-abstract">
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">1) System Programmers Workshop</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-2">Commences at 12 noon, Sunday October 10th in the 8th floor conference
+Room at Project MAC: 545 Main Street, (Technology Square), Cambridge,
+Mass.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-3">2) NIC-Tutorial</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-4">Commences at 9:00 A.M., Tuesday, October 12th in the 2nd floor
+Console Area at Project MAC: 545 Main Street, (Technology Square),
+Cambridge, Mass.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-5">3) Protocol, TIP, and Date Management Workshops</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-6">Commences at 9:00 A.M., Tuesday, October 12th.  Persons attending
+these workshops will meet in the 5th floor Conference Room at Project
+MAC: 545 Main Street, (Technology Square), Cambridge, Mass. for a
+short briefing.  Meeting rooms for these three workshops will be
+announced at the briefing.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-7">4) Plenary Session</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-8">Commences at 9:00 A.M., Wednesday, October 13th in the Center for
+Advanced Engineering Study Auditorium, Room 9-150.  (See map)</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-9">5) Cocktails and Dinner</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-10">Cocktails at 5:30 P.M. in the Faculty Club Penthouse.  Roast Prime
+Ribs of Beef will be served at 7:15 P.M. in a Faculty Club dining
+room.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-11">6) Panel Discussion</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-12">Commences at 9:00 A.M., Thursday, October 14th in the CAES
+Auditorium, Room 9-150.  (See map)</t>
